"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70130","stars":4.5,"review_count":130,"categories":["Food","Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":581,"mm_rank":622,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","review_id":"8-NDJSVjgO2DodcPeBSv1g","date":"2016-03-08T15:00:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9346829652786255,"text_excerpt":"Whoa. What has taken me so long to try Pinkberry? I think I was jaded by the glut of fro-yo that infiltrated the market several years ago. Remember TCBY? Fro-yo just tasted like ice cream with no individual flavor that made it stand out. Well, yesterday I was walking around downtown and a young lady was handing out samples. I decided to try one. It was sooooo good! Tart and sweet. That's the best way to describe it. I went inside and ordered a small cone and two toppings; mochi and something else...I don't remember but it was so tasty ...I'm totally addicted to it now!! And the service was really nice, the people were patient. You would think it wouldn't be so hard to make a decision in a..."},{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","review_id":"4eSHXHTzUiSfCalyYt2TiQ","date":"2014-01-27T16:28:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9340896606445312,"text_excerpt":"I always love Pinkberry, so it's hard to go wrong. My sister-in-law and I had a bad lunch experience, so we headed to Pinkberry for some dessert to make up for it. It's a nice clean location, conveniently located on Canal Street, and has a very nice seating area in the back (a few tables/benches, and a gorgeous fountain). The only down sides were no peanut butter crunch topping (my absolute FAVE) and the cashier switched IN THE MIDDLE of doing our order, so the new cashier had to ask us all kinds of questions to finish up. Everyone working there seemed a bit distracted to me. But overall good!"},{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","review_id":"pefJiTyKXG5P5zIBs-nQIg","date":"2014-06-24T10:39:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9320982098579407,"text_excerpt":"love the variety and freshness of the flavors they have here! I usually get mango + yogurt chips + all fruit + whipped cream + wafer cookie = HEAVEN!! ~angels descend from heaven playing harps~ plus while it is dessert it's actually healthy for you. I go to Pinkberry when I don't want to be surprised by the price, it's a flat price depending on size and an employee will fill it up for you. I frequent this place since it's right in front of Harrah's Casino :D"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","photo_id":"Eb_z36iAUkxZk_eD3Q-YaQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Eb_z36iAUkxZk_eD3Q-YaQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8869641423225403},{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","photo_id":"sOVcR5FTKn7EgENLV0eLJQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sOVcR5FTKn7EgENLV0eLJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.869340181350708},{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","photo_id":"qMgpMydM03A9QoRkjq2suA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qMgpMydM03A9QoRkjq2suA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8387256860733032},{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","photo_id":"mnfzXu57iALIT8b6WiC9gA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mnfzXu57iALIT8b6WiC9gA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8298460245132446},{"business_id":"FDx_EgHcBvIRGH4UlyuNCA","photo_id":"C0WCNJM4Jn3BfEtp57_Gpw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/C0WCNJM4Jn3BfEtp57_Gpw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7955695390701294}]},"notebook_case":null}
